window.products.push({"id":731049,"name":"Sted Sherpa Fleece Weighted Blanket 15lbs, Moroccan Pattern Ultra-Soft Warm Sherpa with Premium Ceramic Beads to Relieve Stress, Individual Use on Cou","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7149H2UhUOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Distinctive Moroccan Pattern: This double-side blanket features Moroccan patterned plush fleece with a soft and smooth touch and luxurious lambwool textured Sherpa that’s breathable and gentle on the skin. Toxic-free ceramic beads evenly compartmented and pocketed within 70gsm polyester padding won’t leak or shuffle around, so the compact 7-layer blanket snugly conforms to your body, making you feel dozy and fall asleep right away Stress-relieving Ultimate Sleep Experience: Sted fleece weighted blanket helps with the most relaxing sleep with top-grade ceramic beads and reliable 7-layer construction. With the right size and weight, this blanket will trigger faster and deeper sleep like a baby in mom’s arms or lying under the stars in a tranquil forest, you’ll feel lifted up as tensions leave your body，sleep the whole night, then wake up energized the next day Comfort Anywhere & Best Present: Sted weighted blanket is your top choice for staying cozy. It’s not only the most reliable sleep pal but also your sweetest buddy when you are reading, gaming, working, be it in bed, on couch, or chair. It instantly unwinds you and puts you in calm and joyful mood. It also makes the sweetest gift for Christmas, Thanksgiving, Valentine for the loved ones, friends, and parents Size Choice: We suggest to choose a blanket 8% to 12% of the user’s body weight, i.e. 15lbs blanket is for people of 125 to 170 lbs, 20 lbs blanket for 170 lbs to 250 lbs users. If you are a first time user, start off with a lighter one and you’ll soon adapt to the weight and enjoy its full benefit Care Easy & Reliable Customer Service: Spot clean the blanket for local stains. Use a commercial machine to wash it and tumble dry on low heat. We endeavor to make the best quality blanket to help with most restful sleep. If you have any questions about our product, please contact our customer care and we will respond within 24 hours. Meanwhile, our professional after-sale team will resolve any problems you have with the blanket to your full satisfaction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7149H2UhUOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sted","source_asin":"B095K2J3W6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-731049","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095K2J3W6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095K2J3W6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
