window.products.push({"id":731090,"name":"VASCHY Lunch Box Bag for Kids, Reusable Insulated Lunch Box Containers Coolers for Toddler Boys and Girls with Detachable Shoulder Strap for Daycare S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811TC3J70NS._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"<p>🐟UNIQUE DESIGN: Inspired by the artwork of a loving artist, our exclusive collection channels her spontaneous use of color and childlike sense of wonder. The collection of the kids backpack and lunch box bag set captures the spirits of imagination and fashion which inspire your little one to own their dreams.</p> <p>🐟LIGHTWEIGHT: Weights 0.21kg/0.46LB only. The versatile insulated lunch cooler bag is made from water-resistant polyester fabric and features a square shape with an insulated interior and a vinyl lining for easy cleaning and wiping. Heavy-Duty Polyester Aluminum food-safe lining is durable,tear-resistant and easy to clean .The interior has high density thermal insulation to keep food and drinks cold or hot for hours.</p> <p>🐟CONVENIENT BUCKLE: The lunch box bag features a zipped around main compartment,a front pocket for the small essentials,a mesh see through pocket interior. 2 ways to carry, with the buckle-design handle, your little one could hold the lunch bag on the backpack on-the-go. The adjustable shoulder strap allows to go hands free.</p> <p>🐟SPACIOUS: Dimension:10.2”x8.6”x3.6”/26x22x9cm(WxHxD), Adjustable Shoulder Strap: 28.3”-49.6”/72-126cm, Shoulder Strap Wide:1.1”/3cm, Front Pocket:10”x5.9”/ 25.5x15cm, Interior Mesh Pocket: 10”x6.3”/25.5x16cm, Top Handle:8.7”x1”/22x2.5cm, (LxW), Weight:0.21kg/0.46lb, Capacity:5.1L.</p> <p>🐟IDEAL GIFT: PVC, BPA and Phthalate-free makes this an eco-friendly lunch bag. It’s convenient to take the food with the insulated lunch box for school, picnics, road trips, lunch at the office, the beach and more! Vaschy offers you and your family a unique lunch bag to have fresh and healthy food. Recommended for children from 3 to 6 years old.</p>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811TC3J70NS._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VASCHY","source_asin":"B097TH3SNL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-731090","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097TH3SNL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097TH3SNL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
