window.products.push({"id":731114,"name":"360 PCS Backflow Incense Cones 9 Kinds of Incense Cones for Waterfall Natural Scents for Backflow Incense Burner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51q7sRNKe5L._AC_.jpg","description":"360 pcs Backflow Incense Cones, 9 Kinds of Natural Scents for Spa Yoga Meditation Relax Product Introduction: ➤Incense burning is an ancient tradition. It is loved by many people who like practice, meditation, yoga, etc. It helps people living in a modern industrial civilization to find their inner selves. Features and Benefits: ➤Relaxation and decompression. ➤Bring tranquility and zen to your room. ➤It helps you practice and meditation. ➤Reduces stress and induces sleep. ➤Spice from nature and the fragrance makes you relaxed and happy. Specification: ➤Size: 1.0 X 0.35 In ➤Burningtime: 10 Mins How to Use: ➤Hold the incense cone with tweezers and light it from the tip. ➤Place the lighted incense cone on the top of the incense fountain smoke waterfall burner, and the bottom of the incense cone is aligned with the small hole of the incense burner. Package List: ➤360 X waterfall incense cones Notes: ➤Smoke only converge in still air, please place backflow incense waterfall holder in windless circumstance. ➤The principle of the backflow is the high content of tar which has a greater density than air in smoke, so there'll be tar deposit on the bottom of the holder after several times. Professional Service Team: ➤Please feel free to contact us for replacement or refunds if there are any issues with your incense cones. ➤All our products are under strict quality inspection. ➤Lifetime technical support. Click on the add to cart button now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51q7sRNKe5L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mengmall","source_asin":"B0BHLNYTM2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-731114","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHLNYTM2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHLNYTM2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
