window.products.push({"id":731234,"name":"Isaac Jacobs 11x14 (Matted 8x10) Blue w/Brown (Vertical & Horizontal) Double Border Picture Frame, Wall-Mountable, Made for Photo Gallery and Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UbV6O4suS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This Isaac Jacobs Blue and Brown Picture Frame surrounds your photographs with the allure of a double border effect that draws the eye to the beauty displayed in the frame. Whether you fill this frame with landscape photos of the world you live in, or portrait photos of the family you love, when viewed inside this glass frame, your favorite photos will draw attention like works of art. The inner and outer edging to this frame has detailed ridges and an outer rim top layer that adds a shine and an extra dimension to the frame. The wide border area of this frame resembles finished wood and has a smooth, lightweight feel that helps give the frame a stylish allure. The chic design and simple, clean look of this modern frame enables it to blend in nicely on any wall. Hanging this frame vertically or horizontally on a wall can put a finishing touch on your home office. Whether you are displaying your child’s smiling face in your workspace or hanging a photo of a sunset to create a relaxing vibe, this frame will stand out in any interior space. This contemporary glass frame has a traditional, black velvet backing with 2-way hanging tabs. It can be easily hung in either position on any wall by using the built-in hooks. A black-and-white architectural photograph will be beautifully displayed like a work of art on the wall. This frame is designed to draw attention to the photo within the double border and it makes a welcome choice for the home or office. The overall dimensions of the frame are 13.3” L x 16.5” W, and it is intended to beautifully display 8x10 photos with the mat or 11x14 photos without the mat. This frame comes in multiple colors and sizes. The charming frame makes a welcome gift for friends, family and anyone redecorating a room or moving into a new home. We spend so much time flipping through images on screens all day, it feels good to see our memories and passions preserved in style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UbV6O4suS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Isaac Jacobs International","source_asin":"B098RCHZZD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-731234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098RCHZZD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098RCHZZD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":731235,"name":"Nautica Home | Craver Collection | 100% Cotton Cozy & Soft, Durable & Breathable Striped Comforter & Matching Sham(s), King, Navy/White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":105.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1mPbqSDvlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get ready for the upcoming school year with a new bedding collection from Nautica. The Nautical horizontal stripes on this ensemble will perfectly update any dorm room or apartment. Convenient for students heading back to school, the comforter packaging doubles as a bonus laundry bag. Comforter features a polyester fill. Included shams feature a zipper closure. Ensemble is machine washable for easy care. Twin/ twin xl comforter set includes: 92” l x 66\"w comforter and one 21” l x 27\"w standard sham. Full/queen comforter set includes: 96” l x 86\"w comforter and two 21” l x 27\"w standard shams. King comforter set includes: 96” l x 104” w comforter and two 21” l x 37” w king shams.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1mPbqSDvlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nautica Home","source_asin":"B0C5ZFQL42","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-731235","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5ZFQL42","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5ZFQL42","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
