window.products.push({"id":731237,"name":"Tiyard 36pcs Artificial Eucalyptus Leaves Stems Real Grey Green Touch Leaf Branches for Home Office Flowers Bouquet Centerpiece Wedding Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AWG5oerzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Package includes] There are total 36pcs artificial eucalyptus stems. Each eucalyptus stems is around 14.17in in length and has 13 leaves. [Realistic Artificial Eucalyptus] Using high-quality materials and strict production process, our artificial eucalyptus leaves stems are true to nature and full of vitality. These artificial eucalyptus leaves are a good choice to add natural landscape to your life without taking up much space. They are elegant for any use scenario or home decor. [Versatile Use] These artificial eucalyptus stems can be shaped optionally due to the iron wire embedded. Combine the artificial eucalyptus stems with different kinds of flowers to make bouquets or use several eucalyptus stems with a mini vase to table decor at will. You can also use them to make wall hanging decor, door wreaths and so much more. [Maintenance Free] These artificial eucalyptus leaves stems are made of high-quality materials, making it last for a long time. Skipping those hassle of watering, sun lighting, fertilizing and pruning, you can save your precious time. [Sincere Note] These artificial eucalyptus leaves surface has been specially treated with white powders to simulate real plants. They are not dust. We take pride in delivering a quality product. If there is any issue with your purchase, do not hesitate to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AWG5oerzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tiyard","source_asin":"B09C1Q1S15","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-731237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C1Q1S15","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C1Q1S15","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":731238,"name":"BandTie Convenient Travel Office Loose Leaf Tea Brewing System-Chinese Jingdezhen Blue and White Porcelain Tea Cup Infuser 4-Piece Set with Tea Cup Li","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.12,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+Bw-W5PRL._AC_SL1105_.jpg","description":"WHAT IS BLUE AND WHITE PORCELAIN Blue and white porcelain,also known as the white ground blue and white porcelain, often referred to as \"blue and white\". It is one of the mainstream of Chinese porcelain. “blue and white\"is to use natural materials in white mud painting decoration, then cover in a transparent glaze, and then the next firing on high temperature,1300 degrees Celsius high-temperature calcination,  make the pigment sufficient penetration in billet glaze, rendering the beautiful and luxuriant.  Then,it will appear blue color decorative pattern, which is deep and remote,bright and clean simple but elegant. BandTie 4-Piece personal teacup,1 set include a cup lid,a cup,a tea strainer and a saucer. This is a professional tea cup,Suitable for all kinds of black tea,green tea,flower tea and pu'er tea. ENJOY YOUR TEA ★ When you are meeting in the meeting room, you can make a cup of strong tea to take in. ★ When you are reading a book quietly in the study room, you can make a cup of green tea to take in. ★ When you appreciate the outside flowers in your house,you can make a cup of jasmine tea with this teacup...... HOW TO MAKE YOUR TEA WITH THIS TEACUP 1.Choose the tea you like to drink and the boiling water. 2.Put suitable amount of tea leaves into the filter and set in the tea body. 3.Pour boiling fresh water in.Normally speaking,we will not drink the tea for the first time make. We call the first time make is wash tea leaves.Someone may be wash twice or more. 4.Soak the tea leaves in the filter for a while(about 5-20 second). 5.Take out your tea strainer,you can put it on the saucer.It's very convenience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+Bw-W5PRL._AC_SL1105_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BandTie","source_asin":"B01CWVIZ2O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-731238","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CWVIZ2O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CWVIZ2O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
