window.products.push({"id":731291,"name":"Personalized Custom Husband and Wife Camping Partners for Life Christmas Birthday Fleece Sherpa Blanket Customized Christmas Birthday Wedding Annivers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RncXNikTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【PRINTED & ASSEMBLED IN USA】All of our Fleece and Sherpa blankets are handcrafted to the highest quality standards and shipped out from USA-based factory in Detroit, MI. A Personalized Custom Name Location Husband and Wife Camping Partners for Life Couple RV Camper Blanket is a unique sentimental gifts for certain special occasions such as Birthday, Wedding Anniversary, Appreciation, Graduation, Christmas, Halloween, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Father's day, etc. 【PREMIUM MATERIAL】Each fleece blanket features a premium 100 % suede polyester print for beautiful color vibrancy, even after washing. The sherpa blanket features premium silky smooth mink front and fluffy sherpa back side. Cozy underside is constructed from an ultra-soft micro fleece fabric to keep you warm and comfortable. 【BOTH FUNCTIONAL AND DECORATIVE】These blankets are great for a picnic at the park, snuggling while watching TV, relaxing on the sofa, wall decoration for home or as a stylish bedspread. As a part of bedding set on bed or wrap you in while reading a book or just relaxing on sofa or couch, enjoy family happy hours while watching favorite TV shows - Perfect for indoor and outdoor use to provide consecutive warmth in all seasons, especially for camping and picnic. 【MACHINE WASHABLE】Wash separately in cold water and then either let them air dry without heat. Microfiber dries quickly and it will fluffier than before. It's better wash microfiber fleece blankets in a mesh laundry bag. 【CUSTOMER SATISFACTION】If you have any issue, please send the email that comes with the product for a REPLACEMENT or REFUND with 30-Day Warranty. It is our intention to offer the best items and customer service on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RncXNikTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VTH GLOBAL","source_asin":"B07WMF3CFX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-731291","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WMF3CFX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WMF3CFX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":731292,"name":"OneWorld Memorials Aria Rose Brass Cremation Keepsake Heart - Extra Small - Holds Up to 3 Cubic Inches of Ashes - Pink - Custom Engraving Included","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31lVRROtKKL._AC_.jpg","description":"Smooth, soft, and pastel as the fog lifting from a morning meadow at sunrise. A gold glimmer of light as the sun breaks through, bringing another day - one full with work, play, family, and the quiet joys of life together. Although our lives are marked by big events, it is often the simple moments that stand out. A smile, a laugh, a cup of morning coffee, a family dinner with rain splashing at the windows. These small moments can grow to become memories, and the Aria Rose Heart Cremation Keepsakeis a memorial to each one. Like all sharing urns, this mini keepsake urn can enable one or many members of the family to keep a departed loved one close to hearth and home.Nothing symbolizes eternal love like a rose and a heart, and we’ve combined these two powerful symbols in the OneWorld Memorials Extra-Small Pink Heart-Shaped Keepsake Memorial Urn. This pink urn includes a hand engraved rose at the top of the heart. The pastel color in this Aria Rose keepsake urn will give you feelings of peace every time you see it. Included in the purchase price are an antique bronze stand for upright display as well as personalized engraving.Brass is a lightweight metal alloy made of 90% copper and 10% zinc. It gives off a bright golden appearance when polished. Oftentimes, brass cremation urns are finished with bronze or pewter to strengthen the brass and to alter the color. The bronze finish has a more reddish hue, whereas the pewter finish gives off a silver hue. Brass is also easy to cast in a mold as it is a malleable material that can be coated in enamel or paint. It is used in multiple capacities for a wide variety of purposes and has a long history as a favored material for everything from cookery to fine art to metal cremation urns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31lVRROtKKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OneWorld Memorials","source_asin":"B0767R2JTL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-731292","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0767R2JTL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0767R2JTL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
