window.products.push({"id":731336,"name":"HIGOGOGO Japanese Floor Futon Mattress, Roll Up Sleeping Pad Shikibuton Tatami Mats, Korean Foldable Floor Bed, Sleeper Sofa Bed Mattress Replacement ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":175.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z9G4MocHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Soft & Supportive: THIS SPECIAL FLOOR MATTRESS THAT COMBINE SUPERIOR BACK SUPPORT WITH A SOFT SURFACE. When you lie down, you will feel loose and limp, so relaxed, so deliciously serene, so wonderfully lazy. Multiple Materials Filling: The secret of Soft but Supportive was this: Five-layer Construction: surface + microfiber fill + memory foam + microfiber fill + surface. The surface was premium high thread count fabrics; The second layer is softness layer, 550GSM whole piece microfiber fill; The core layer is support layer, 4 inches memory foam. Five-layer Construction make up the special soft and supportive futon mattress. Easy to Store and Carry: Come with 1 pair of bandage, 1 Cover, 1 storage bag, for better storage and carrying, The foldable tatami floor mattress allows you to get a comfortable sleep wherever you go. Perfect for small apartments and tight spaces, effectively save living space and move easily. You can easily fold it and put in the included storage bag when you don't need it. Easy to travel or store keep it in your closet or other storage location. Multi-functional Mattress: This mattress pad could be used as bedroom futon mattress, floor mattress, carpet, tatami pad, also could be guest bed or tent mattress, mattress topper, mattress pad. Tips: As the tight packed, before first use, leave the floor mattress flatly in a well-ventilated area for 48-72 hours and pat it gently to help it expanded. Time will bring the thickness, fabric and wrinkle to original shape. Please give time a little time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z9G4MocHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIGOGOGO","source_asin":"B0BRPZY1Z2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-731336","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRPZY1Z2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRPZY1Z2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
