window.products.push({"id":731356,"name":"Jordan&Judy Classic Glass Tumblers with Silicone Sleeve - Set of 4 - Pink, Large 13 oz - Eco-friendly Borosilicate Glass.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ds-TIeYQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Classic Tumbler collection comes in a set of 4 flat-bottom glasses made from the same high-quality borosilicate glass as our water bottles. These stylish tumblers are a perfect serving set for any occasion. The Classic Tumblers are available in two sizes: small 8.5 oz and large 13 oz. Also available in four colors: Lake Blue, Light Grey, Pink and Light Blue. Jordan&Judy Classic Glass Tumbler with Silicone Sleeve Lightweight and Classic design. The small tumblers each weigh 4.25 oz, stand 4 inches tall with a 2.5-inch diameter. The large tumblers each weigh 6.85 oz, stand 6 inches tall with a 2.5-inch diameter. Borosilicate Glass Borosilicate glass was first developed in the late 19th century to fulfill a need for glass that would not shatter under extreme temperature changes. The addition of Boron Oxide produces a glass with superior durability, clarity, chemical and heat resistance. It can handle rapid temperature changes, is resistant to thermal shock and less likely to break or shatter. Borosilicate glass is BPA free, BPS free, Lead free and Phthalate free. The non-porous surface does not retain odors or flavors, leaving you with just pure natural taste. Silicone Sleeve Classic look and colors on the tumblers. Silicone sleeve is removable. The non-slip gripping surface also has a soft feel. Sleeve is made from food grade silicone and is bio-degradable. Jordan&Judy – Fashion Life Brand Jordan&Judy is a fashion life brand combining acclaimed artistic design, function and trend to create products that are original, Eco-friendly and cost effective. Our goal is offering product to the modern family that is visibly appealing and adds a stylistic edge to your lifestyle. Our products are responsibly produced to exacting standards in our own factories. With over 20 years of experience, we have proven our ability to drive the market rather than follow.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ds-TIeYQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jordan&Judy","source_asin":"B07DGQ7KQ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-731356","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DGQ7KQ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DGQ7KQ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
