window.products.push({"id":731424,"name":"Ice Cube Trays Silicone Ice Maker No Odor Or Aftertaste 2 Pack Make 30 Ice Cube Easy Release Flexible Ice Freezer Mold Trays With Lids (Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D8q0YjYJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Summer is almost here! Let’s make ice cubes by ourselves. You don’t need to buy the beverage in the outside. Just can make it at home, so you can drink anywhere and anytime! Can you imagine enjoy a cup of beverage with the ice while watching the TV or reading a book? This is awesome. Features - 1.25 Inch cubes, perfectly sized to cool your beverage to the perfect temperature, with minimum dilution!  - Easy to use - With a simple push, the cube will just pop out!  - No odor or aftertaste - The silicone we use preserves the water's pure taste.  - Sturdy and stackable ice trays that won't spill contents, and allow stacking multiple trays on top of each other, no need for cover or lid!  - Easy to clean! Just put in the dishwasher.  - Can be used in temperature from -40 up to 464 degrees Fahrenheit.  - Medium sized ice cubes that suit all different type of glasses. Specifications: Material: PP & TPE (Silicone)  Dimensions: 7.3x4.5x1.4 inch ( L x W x H )  Weight: 158g (1 Pack )   Package Included: 2 x Ice Cube Trays (Total 30 Ice Cube) Note: 1. Do not use metal brush to clean these ice cube trays.  2. Do not clean the ice cube trays with strong detergent in case they get corroded.  3. Keep these ice cube trays away from fire sources in case they get distorted.  4. Please do NOT overflow the cells with water.You'd better not add too much water in case the ice and the cover sticking together.  5. After freezing, please give icy tray a twist to loosen the cubes, then place the tray in a large freezer bag and pop each cube out. Just click 'add to cart' and join our thousands of satisfied customers!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51D8q0YjYJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOXHA","source_asin":"B07PSFQJNW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-731424","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PSFQJNW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PSFQJNW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
