window.products.push({"id":731492,"name":"CrystalAge Nunderite Tumble Stone (20-25mm)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MlenOfwoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nunderite is a mixture of brown Andalusite Quartz and Epidote and comes from New South Wales in Australia. It is an excellent stone to use for emotional cleansing as it rids the body of all negative attachments. Each tumble stone has been tumble polished, a process that smoothes and polishes the crystal to reveal its unique colour and form. Tumble stones are a wonderful way to enjoy crystals, whether for their beauty or healing powers. Our tumblestones make an ideal healing crystal - the perfect size to hold, place on the body or carry with you. They make great gifts and we have a wide range of inexpensive tumbled stones to add to your crystal collection or bring a little natural beauty into your home. Product Code: T208 Chakra: Heart (Anahata or Fourth Chakra) Stone Types: \t \t Andalusite \t \t \t Epidote","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MlenOfwoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CrystalAge","source_asin":"B0759QX64X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-731492","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0759QX64X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0759QX64X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
