window.products.push({"id":731668,"name":"JSYMJSY Couples Pillow, Breathable Memory Foam Pillow for Arm Rest, Arched Cuddle Anti-Hand Pressure Pillow for Couples Sleeping, Memory Foam Pillows ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c59qh7xxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"💕 Product Features: ➤Do you like to let your partner sleep on your arm? Although this is very romantic and can increase the emotional connection between lovers, do you know the dangers of sleeping on your arm for a long time? ➤This can easily lead to poor blood circulation in the arm for a long time, which can cause neurological damage; if you maintain this posture for 5 hours, it will affect the function of the limbs, and more seriously, it will cause muscle necrosis! ➤If you have our comfortable and breathable couples pillow arched cuddle pillow, you and your partner will effectively avoid this cause. ➤In terms of design, our cuddle pillow for adults has an excellent arch and extended arm design, which not only fits the couple’s neck and shoulders perfectly, but also allows your partner’s arm to reach a perfect stretched state. ➤The material of the couple pillow is also ingenious, using hand-knitted surface and natural breathable memory foam filling, excellent slow rebound effect, without any sense of pressure, thereby improving the sleeping posture and quality of couples. ➤As a gift, this comfortable memory foam pillows for sleeping is also a good choice. Your partner, family, and friends will love it. 💕 Specification: ➤Size: about 25.6\"x19.26\"x4.72\" ➤Structure: slow rebound memory cotton + full polyester inner cover + breathable silk-like fabric cover 💕 Note: ☀ After opening the package and leaving it for 48 hours, the compressed pillow will bounce back to its proper shape. ❶Due to different light conditions, please allow slight deviation for color. ❷Store in a cool and dry place, away from direct sunlight. Only use a damp cloth to clean the inner core. Do not put foam in the washing machine! ❸If the smell you are experiencing is a \"fresh foam\" smell. A few days after the pillow is unpacked and dried, the peculiar smell should dissipate. It will not affect your health.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c59qh7xxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JSYMJSY","source_asin":"B08G1VDKLL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-731668","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G1VDKLL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G1VDKLL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
