window.products.push({"id":731687,"name":"Artificial Tiger Lily 5pcs Latex Fake Flowers Real Touch Bouquet for Wedding Party Home Office Garden Hotel Decor (Light Pink)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-8Epw5fnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Material: The artificial lily flowers are well made of eco-friendly latex which make lily flowers, buds and leaves more vivid like real flowers. It is easy to adjust the height of the flower. You can cut or bend stems. Size: The total height is about 15 inches, the head diameter is about 5.9 inches, and stem is about 7.4 inches. 5pcs single stems consist of one bouquet, and each stem has 1pcs fully bloomed lily flower head, 3pcs closed buds, and 5pcs leaves (Not Include the vase). Application: The fake tiger lily are great decorations for home, offices, parties, stores, stages, parlors, bedrooms, also used on wedding, birthday, Valentine's Day, etc. And it is the best choice for people who are allergic to the real flowers. They can keep beautiful all the year without sunlight and water. Symbol: The artificial lily flowers symbolize harmoniousness, elegance, great love and purity, and it is the best gift to someone you love. Warm Tips: Don’t put the artificial lily flowers in direct sunshine, which makes the fake flowers oxidized and yellow. If the fake flowers are stained with dust, you can wipe with a dry cloth to clean. After receiving the flowers, please adjust them by hand to make them restore the original shape. If there is excess latex on them, you can peel it off by hand. If the flower falls, you can stick it up with ordinary glue.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-8Epw5fnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aiinoo","source_asin":"B095SNCTGM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-731687","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095SNCTGM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095SNCTGM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":731688,"name":"Premium Kitchen Towels - Large Cotton Kitchen Hand Towels | 6 Pack - Popcorn Design (16\" x 26\") | 430 GSM Highly Absorbent Tea Towels Set with Hanging","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1MmtoRX-fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ring Spun Cotton,cotton SOFT & ABSORBENT: These thirsty kitchen towels are made from 100% ring spun cotton yarn, which help keep your home clean and sanitary. They are machine washable, and of course, reusable, effectively soaking up way more than paper towels ENVIRONMENT FRIENDLY: These absorbent hand towels are great for promoting a healthier, cleaner environment for your home. They soak up way more than paper towels and are reusable. They’ll look great through hundreds of wash cycles - which saves you from spending hundreds of dollars on cheap paper towels. GENEROUS 6-PACK: Spills and messes can happen at any moment when you’re working in the kitchen and a pack of six towels means you’ll always have a fresh one handy when you need it. Clean hand towels keep germs and contamination from spreading to your family’s food. HANGING LOOP & BONUS TOTE BAG INCLUDED: Your new kitchen hand towels by Bumble will arrive at your door wrapped in our signature elegant tote bag which makes a great gift for your loved ones. Take your carry bag with you to the pool, beach, and even the gym. CARE FOR YOUR TOWELS: Wash your new kitchen towels before the first use to remove any excess lint leftover from the manufacturing process. Always wash your towels separately to avoid transfer of lint onto your garments. Machine wash warm and tumble dry low.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1MmtoRX-fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bumble Towels","source_asin":"B07SGYVNCC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-731688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SGYVNCC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SGYVNCC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
