window.products.push({"id":731695,"name":"Ecoart Peel and Stick Backsplash Tiles, Mosaic Decorative Tile Stickers 10\" X 10\" for Bathroom and Kitchen(6 Pack) (Blue Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J29INfE8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Features For fashion decoration, easy to install，easy to maintain，easy to remove， and saves you time and money. Product Advantages Compare to traditional tiles, our tiles are much lighter and thinner. They are incredibly easy for you to apply on wall in minutes.The prices are much competitive.Our tiles are great saver for you to redecorate your home. If you get tired of the same design, just peel and change a new style. Easy to install Step 1-You should thoroughly clean and dry your wall.Step 2-Overlap the tiles and grout lines, peel off the backing and stick side by side for a seamless appearance. Step 3-Press firmly after confirming the place. Easy to maintain Stains can be easily removed with a cleaning product using a sponge. Easy to remove You could use a hair dryer to warm up the adhesive and pull softly starting with the corners.Then use a cleaning product to remove the excess glue left by the peel and stick tiles. Used widely in home decoration. The tile is used widely for house decoration(kitchen backsplash,bathroom,wall,home decor and DIY décor). Kindly Remind 1.Surface Requirement: The tile need to be installed over very clean and sleek surface,Please note that rough surfaces such as brick wall, stone wall, gypsum wall, stucco wall, plywood wall, orange peel wall, or oily wall are not suitable to install.2.The new arrived peel and stick wall tiles may have little gel smell. The smell will dispel in 2-3 days.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J29INfE8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ecoart","source_asin":"B07JRBQLQM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-731695","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JRBQLQM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JRBQLQM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
