window.products.push({"id":731754,"name":"Masticating Slow Juicer, Cold Press Juicer Machines for Pomegranate Celery Orange Carrots Wheatgrass, Juicer Extractor de Jugos y Vegetales, Easy To U","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611FNvbAx7L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Start A Healthier Life】Updated in 2023, this juice extractor comes with advanced 7-segment auger masticating system and better filter, extracting maximum juice from vegetables and fruits in 7 steps- cut, break, squeeze, mill, seperate, grind and extract. Every drop is pure and delicious. Forget bottled juices that are super high in sugar and additives, Get healthy, enzyme rich, fresh juice, boost your immunity, keep away from diseases. Bring health and wellness home with this juicer. 【Choose The Right Juicer】Why this cold pressed juicer? Operating at slow speed 45-65RPM, the auger juicer squeezes the vegetables and fruits very slowly, which helps to preserve all of the vital enzymes and nutrients. One-speed control design, easy to handle soft & hard fruits and vegetables, especially for leafy greens. Centrifugal juicers utilize a fast-spinning blade that generates heat, which destroys enzymes and oxidizes nutrients. Meanwhile, they can't handle leafy greens very well. 【Enjoyable Juicing Experience】One-click assembly, no tools required, each step has been optimized to ensure the easiest assembly and disassembly of your juicer extractor. Quiet motor, sturdy horizontal design, you won’t have the vibrations, shaking and noise issue that Centrifugal juicers often come with. Removable components are dishwasher-safe, easy to clean with water. You don't have to spend the time scrubbing off all the little bits like other juicers. 【Safe Material, Worry-free Use】All detachable parts are made of high-quality raw material, BPA Free, safe to use in a long term. The electric juicer has reverse function to avoid stuck. 200W motor, incredibly powerful for juicing apple, celery, orange, parsley, spinach, kale, wheatgrass, beet, carrot, etc. Using baking paint process, the surface of the juicer machine is smooth and bright, easier to clean and looks more textured than the plastic shell, glowing like new after decades of use. 【LUFVEBUT Brand, Leading Warranty & Service】Unique design concept, strong R&D production capacity, we have always focused on the needs of families for high quality juicers and continue to innovate. All juicers are ETL and GS certificated, we offer 2-year warranty for all components. You will enjoy lifetime technical support and 24/7 customer service, any questions, please contact us asap, we will respond immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611FNvbAx7L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUFVEBUT","source_asin":"B09FPRVFQP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-731754","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FPRVFQP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FPRVFQP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
