window.products.push({"id":731816,"name":"Newhai Commercial Vegetable Slicer Electric Potato Slicing Machine Automatic Fruit Slicer 0-10mm (0-0.4’’) Stainless Steel for Cabbage Onion Tomato (1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":269.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CkoN-jGjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"0-10mm THICKNESS ADJUSTABLE---The vegetable slicer is equipped with an adjustable thickness feature that allows you to customize the thickness of your vegetables to your liking. You can adjust the thickness of the slicer from 0 to 10mm (0 to 0.4 inches) to achieve the perfect cut every time. To adjust the thickness, simply rotate the bolt located at the center of the machine to your desired setting. This easy-to-use feature makes the vegetable slicer a versatile tool for any kitchen. ELECTRIC OR MANUAL USE---The electric vegetable cutting machine comes with a comfortable handle that makes it easy to use. When you want to use the cutter manually, such as during a power outage, simply detach the machine from the power outlet and use it with the handle for added convenience. This versatile feature allows you to use the machine even in outdoor settings, making it an essential tool for home cooks and adventurers alike. LARGE CAPACITY---The commercial vegetable slicer comes with a storage slot that measures 25X13cm (9.8''X5.1''), providing enough space to hold up to 8 lemons at a time. The fruit slicer is designed to accommodate ingredients of different lengths, and it is equipped with a push rod that can be adjusted to suit your needs. This push rod feature adds to the convenience of using the slicer, allowing you to easily and safely slice your fruits and vegetables without the need for additional tools. DURABLE MATERIALS---The electric fruit slicer features a high-quality body made of food-grade stainless steel, ensuring that it is resistant to rust and safe for long-term use. The blade of the slicer is constructed with thickened aluminum alloy, providing a sharper and more durable cutting edge, ensuring precise slicing every time. Additionally the blade is designed to be easily removable, and cleaning the slicer is simple and effortless. APPLICATIONS---The commercial electric slicer is a versatile tool with a wide range of applications, making it a practical investment for families, restaurants, and fruit shops. With its ability to slice fruits, vegetables, and other food items with ease, it can save you time and effort in the kitchen, whether you are preparing meals for yourself or catering for a large party. It also makes for a perfect gift for your wife or friends on their birthdays or other special occasions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CkoN-jGjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Newhai","source_asin":"B08T1H5LMH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-731816","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T1H5LMH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T1H5LMH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
